---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | RiddlesMaster"
  description="Learn about RiddlesMaster, our vision, and how we help software engineers prepare for brain teasers and logic puzzles in technical interviews."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[800px] px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <article class="prose prose-[#141413] max-w-none">
      <h1
        class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-normal tracking-tight text-[#141413] font-serif mb-6 leading-tight"
      >
        About RiddlesMaster
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed mb-6 font-normal">
        At RiddlesMaster, we believe that logical deduction, lateral thinking,
        and problem-solving are skills that can be practiced and mastered.
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#3d3d3a] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Our platform is designed specifically for software engineers, product
          managers, and quantitative analysts preparing for technical interviews
          at top-tier firms like Google, Microsoft, Amazon, and Jane Street.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          Our Vision
        </h2>
        <p>
          Many engineering interviews incorporate logic puzzles or brain teasers
          to evaluate how candidates approach complex, open-ended scenarios
          under pressure. Instead of memorizing solutions, RiddlesMaster helps
          you build a systematic framework for dissecting lateral-thinking
          puzzles. We focus on exposing the underlying mathematical and logical
          patterns behind each problem.
        </p>

        <h2
          class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-normal text-[#141413] font-serif mt-10 mb-4"
        >
          What We Offer
        </h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>
            <strong>Curated Puzzle Library:</strong> Hand-picked, company-tagged riddles
            ranging from easy probability concepts to hard algorithmic thinking.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>In-Depth Editorials:</strong> Thorough, step-by-step mathematical
            explanations and logical breakdowns that teach you the core problem-solving
            models.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Daily Streaks:</strong> Consistency is key. Keeping your daily
            streak alive ensures continuous development of logical faculties.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
